518
00:42:22.414 --> 00:42:24.208
Bakit gusto mong malaman iyon?

519
00:42:24.291 --> 00:42:25.125
Excuse me?

520
00:42:26.001 --> 00:42:27.461
kasi…

521
00:42:29.922 --> 00:42:35.010
Nalaman ng lahat
binaligtad mo ang interview room,

522
00:42:35.094 --> 00:42:37.346
